  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WEDO - Ensuring Gender Just Climate Action Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&#x2019;s Environment and Development Organisation (WEDO) is a women&#x2019;s advocacy organisation that focuses on the protection of human rights, gender equality and the environment. It works with grassroots and women-led organisations from developing countries, including LDCs and SIDS, and coordinates the work of the UNFCCC Women and Gender Constituency. It aims to strengthen the impact of these organisations, monitors both the impact of climate finance on gender-just climate solutions; and supports national gender-responsive climate action</narrative>
  </description>
